---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Before You Buy Property in Marbella, Spain | Costa Ledger" 
  minimalHeader={true} 
  headerLabel="SPECIAL INTELLIGENCE REPORT" 
  isAdvertorial={true}
>
  <main class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-10 sm:py-14">
    
    <!-- ARTICLE HEADER (VAULT STYLE) -->
    <header class="mb-8 border-b border-[#E5E4DF] pb-6 text-left max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <!-- TITLE -->
      <h1 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-[#121212] leading-tight mb-6">
        Before You Buy Property in Marbella, Spain, There’s Something More Important Than the Sea View
      </h1>

      <!-- LEDE WITH GOLD ACCENT LINE -->
      <div class="border-l-2 border-[#C5A059] pl-4 sm:pl-5 py-0.5">
        <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-[#666666] font-sans leading-relaxed italic">
          The property can look perfect and still be wrong for the life you actually plan to live.
        </p>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- HERO IMAGE -->
    <div class="mb-10 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <img 
        src="/us-buyers-spain.jpg" 
        alt="US and International Buyers in the Spanish Real Estate Market" 
        class="w-full h-[280px] sm:h-[400px] object-cover border border-[#E5E4DF] shadow-sm"
      />
      <!-- IMAGE CAPTION -->
      <span class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#666666] mt-2.5 block text-right italic font-sans">
        Strategic capital deployment and cross-border property utility, Southern Spain.
      </span>
    </div>

    <!-- CONTENT (CLEAN UNIFORM TEXT) -->
    <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto font-sans text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed text-[#2A2E33] space-y-6">
      <p>
        Marbella makes it remarkably easy to fall in love with property. Sea views, terraces, new developments, golf communities and homes close to the Mediterranean can move an international buyer from casual interest to serious consideration very quickly.
      </p>

      <p>
        But one of the biggest mistakes a buyer can make is allowing the property to define the plan before the plan has defined the property.
      </p>

      <p>
        Someone spending six weeks a year in Spain may need a secure, low-maintenance home that is easy to reach and easy to leave. A family relocating permanently may care much more about schools, healthcare and everyday driving. A future retiree may eventually value walkability and access to daily services more than the spectacular hillside view that first caught their attention.
      </p>

      <p>
        The same applies to money. The advertised price is not the entire commitment. Acquisition costs, furnishing, community charges, insurance, maintenance and financing can all affect what the home really costs. International buyers also have to think about currency when most of their assets are held in dollars, pounds or Canadian dollars.
      </p>

      <p>
        And there is another question that deserves attention before buying: what happens if your plans change? A second home might later become a primary residence. A property intended only for personal use may eventually need to be rented or sold. The home should ideally have enough flexibility to survive those changes.
      </p>

      <p class="font-medium text-[#121212]">
        The strongest property search therefore starts with the buyer, not the listings.
      </p>

      <p>
        If you are considering Marbella or another part of Southern Spain, Costa Ledger can help you narrow the decision around how you actually plan to use the property.
      </p>

      <!-- THREE STEPS SECTION -->
      <div class="pt-4 pb-2 border-t border-[#E5E4DF]">
        <h2 class="font-serif font-bold text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#121212] mb-4">
          Follow These Three Easy Steps:
        </h2>
        
        <ol class="space-y-3 pl-5 list-decimal text-base sm:text-lg text-[#2A2E33]">
          <li><strong>Tell us your approximate budget.</strong></li>
          <li><strong>Tell us how you expect to use the property.</strong></li>
          <li><strong>See which locations and property types may deserve a closer look.</strong></li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- HIGH-CONVERTING CTA BLOCK (BRAND STYLED) -->
    <div class="mt-14 max-w-2xl mx-auto bg-[#F9F9F6] border border-[#C5A059] p-8 sm:p-10 text-center shadow-lg rounded-sm">
      <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-[#121212] mb-3">
        See Which Options Fit You
      </h3>
      
      <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-[#666666] font-sans mb-6 max-w-lg mx-auto">
        Speak with our advisory desk to evaluate your criteria and discover which locations and property configurations align with your actual usage.
      </p>

      <a 
        href="/special/apply" 
        data-track="cta"
        class="inline-block w-full sm:w-auto bg-[#C5A059] hover:bg-[#B28E46] text-white text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] px-10 py-4 transition-all shadow-md hover:shadow-xl cursor-pointer"
      >
        Continue
      </a>

      <p class="text-xs text-[#666666] italic mt-4 font-sans">
        (No obligations. 100% Secure.)
      </p>
    </div>

  </main>
</Layout>